# Changelog
## [0.4.0] - 2026-11-04
### Breaking changes
 - N/A

### New features
 - pause: add parsed configuration and set support. (a60f235)
 - Introduce EthtoolBitset. (e597991)
 - coalesce: Add missing attributes. (a38be5a)

### Bug fixes
 - Use netlink-proto 0.14.1. (ac293ab)
 - cargo: use sudo to run integration tests. (8c3e077)
 - tests: add per-subsystem integration tests. (00eda7a)
 - examples: one query example per subsystem and list them in README. (f5cdc39)
 - Add captured packet tests for all supported commands. (f8d34b9)
 - pause: fix Tx stat attribute id. (c97c35d)
 - fec: use EthtoolBitset and fix stats parsing. (6004c09)
 - tsinfo: use EthtoolBitset and fix nested bitset emitting. (815706a)
 - link_mode: use EthtoolBitset and fix nested bitset emitting. (2c05e44)
 - feature: use EthtoolBitset for feature bitsets. (c9b949f)
 - Fix emitting of unknown/other attributes. (a64e220)
 - LICENSE: fix LICENSE-MIT. (2c103d0)

## [0.3.0] - 2026-08-18
### Breaking changes
 - Use latest rust-netlink crates. (7f6f09d)

### New features
 - Change TryStream to Stream. (15810b2)
 - Adding support for dumping eeprom pages.. (f923530)

### Bug fixes
 - Cargo: Use `futures-util` and `futures-channel` to replace `futures` crate. (f79bc8b)
 - link_mode: Support convert EthtoolLinkModeDuplex to u8. (64382a5)

